flowchart TD
StartNode["**Start**<br/>Begin optimization"]
NSGA2_Optimizer["**NSGA2 Optimizer**<br/>pop_size, n_gen, sampling, crossover, mutation"]
BufferCapacityProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>n_var 6, n_obj 2, n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>method _evaluate"]
Population["**Population**<br/>individuals X, objectives F"]
Individual["**Individual**<br/>decision variables caps x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 {1-10}"]
EvaluatePopulation["**Evaluate Population**<br/>create evaluation tasks for each individual"]
MultiprocessingPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>processes n_cores map tasks evaluate_single_individual"]
EvaluateSingle["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>inputs x n_replications base_seed warmup measure_until<br/>validates caps range and runs replications<br/>returns objectives [avg_wip, -avg_throughput]"]
RunWithCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>inputs seed caps warmup measure_until<br/>instantiates buffers and machines runs simulation returns result dict"]
RunSimulation["**run_simulation**<br/>creates simpy env part generation sampling wip collection<br/>runs warmup and measurement windows"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer**<br/>attributes cap delay tokens store<br/>methods put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
MachineNode["**Machine**<br/>attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power defect_rate capacity<br/>methods run _breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
MetricsNode["**Metrics Collector**<br/>computes throughput avg_wip produced_parts machine_energy dict"]
CollectResults["**Collect Results**<br/>pool returns list of objective pairs for population"]
NSGA2_Update["**Update Population**<br/>assign F selection crossover mutation elimination"]
HistoryNode["**History Archive**<br/>stores generation index individuals X and F for export"]
ExportCSV["**Export History CSV**<br/>iterates history writes feasible solutions to results csv"]
EndNode["**End**<br/>Optimization complete CSV exported"]

StartNode --> NSGA2_Optimizer
NSGA2_Optimizer --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> Population
Population --> Individual
Population --> EvaluatePopulation
EvaluatePopulation --> MultiprocessingPool
MultiprocessingPool --> EvaluateSingle
EvaluateSingle --> RunWithCaps
RunWithCaps --> RunSimulation
RunSimulation --> DelayBuffer
RunSimulation --> MachineNode
DelayBuffer --> MetricsNode
MachineNode --> MetricsNode
MetricsNode --> RunWithCaps
RunWithCaps --> EvaluateSingle
MultiprocessingPool --> CollectResults
CollectResults --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> NSGA2_Update
NSGA2_Update --> Population
NSGA2_Update --> HistoryNode
NSGA2_Optimizer --> HistoryNode
HistoryNode --> ExportCSV
ExportCSV --> EndNode